          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a product morph loop about skincare science.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with hard side light with 80 percent of the frame falling into shadow and grade to a neutral commercial grade with clean whites and no colour cast.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
